msgstr "and look for a line like:"

msgid "Reboot the computer now?"
msgstr "Reboot the computer now?"

msgid "Are you sure? The system will reboot immediately and the selected GPU will become primary on boot."
msgstr "Are you sure? The system will reboot immediately and the selected GPU will become primary on boot."

msgid "Apply sets %s (PCI %s) as the primary display adapter.\n\nThe managed udev rule is written; if a rule is present, a backup is saved. The change takes effect after a reboot, or after logging out and back in."
msgstr "Apply sets %s (PCI %s) as the primary display adapter.\n\nThe managed udev rule is written; if a rule is present, a backup is saved. The change takes effect after a reboot, or after logging out and back in."

msgid "Apply removes the managed udev rule, returning to automatic GPU selection.\n\nIf a rule is present, a backup is saved. The change takes effect after a reboot, or after logging out and back in."
msgstr "Apply removes the managed udev rule, returning to automatic GPU selection.\n\nIf a rule is present, a backup is saved. The change takes effect after a reboot, or after logging out and back in."

msgid "The configured GPU (PCI %s) is not currently detected. The rule remains on disk; it takes effect when the GPU is available again. Use 'Reset to auto' to remove it."
msgstr "The configured GPU (PCI %s) is not currently detected. The rule remains on disk; it takes effect when the GPU is available again. Use 'Reset to auto' to remove it."

msgid "The configured GPU (PCI %s) is not currently detected, so there is nothing to apply. The rule stays on disk; use 'Reset to auto' to remove it."
msgstr "The configured GPU (PCI %s) is not currently detected, so there is nothing to apply. The rule stays on disk; use 'Reset to auto' to remove it."

